2 CONC ng birth. That is why many men were married two or three times during their lives.
2 CONT
2 CONT After looking at all the children's profiles, it looks like five children died within the first year of life. Must have been very sad for the family. It is amazing that she survived giving birth to seventeen children. Death played
2 CONC  a larger part in the lives of our ancestors as compared to our modern lives, many trips were taken to the graveyard.
