1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jose Francisco Chavez is of the generation of ancestors that would have been born at the dates between 1821 and 1848. That geographic area my ancestor families were living in known as Las Palomas were probably flyi
2 CONC ng the Mexican flag as result of Mexico gaining independence from Spain in 1821. Spain had claimed that territory as belonging to Spain from 1598 when Onate established forts there to include Santa Fe in 1610 or sooner possibly ar
2 CONC ound 1548 when Coronado would have concluded the exploration visits or even earlier with other explorers reporting cities of gold to be found.  In 1948 that geographic area became a territory of the United States of America as a r
2 CONC esult of land purchase deals between Mexico and USA . That territory was divided into 2 states and became Arizona and New Mexico and in 1912.
