2 NOTE I remember Granny would come over and play cards with my Grandmother and Aunt Sophie on North street....and Aunt Sophie always had a great joke to tell me....those days were some of the greatest times to be a kid....i miss them al
3 CONC l so much...
2 NOTE I remember Grandpa and Grandma loved to play cards.  Mom and Aunt Siohie would play with them and if they couldn't make it me and Nickie would have to play.  They did not like to lose.
2 NOTE That is so funny.....I can totally see/hear it!!  I guess I know where my Hamo got her feistiness!!
2 NOTE I remember walking up on my grandma when I was about 5-6 years old and she was smoking.  I told her that I was going to tell my dad she was smoking.  She said " I will give your dad a spanking"
2 NOTE I remember her soft skin.  And I remember making her an ashtray in school....LOL!!  She liked it, what a funny thing to remember!
2 NOTE This is a nice picture.  I wish I would have got to know my grandfather, but my grandmother was a sweet caring lady that attempted to steer me right.
2 NOTE I love this pic...wouldn't it be neat to go back in time to talk with them just once. I would love that.
