1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Son of John Romero and Cecilia Nilsdotter
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Hannah Mortensen, 6 Jun 1888, Mt. Pleasant, Sanpete, Utah
2 CONT
2 CONT Children - James Andrew Romero, Amy Henrietta Romero, Alvin Leonal Romero, Ada Ruth Romero, Hannah Naomi Romero, Zella Cecelia Romero, Calvin Kenneth Romero, Ervin Romero, Golden Sylvanus Romero, Harland Victor Romero, Annie Elvin
2 CONC a Juanita Romero, Faunda Gweneviere Romero, Henry Forrest Solon Romero
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Jennie Louise Jolls, 1 Sep 1938, Soda Springs, Caribou, Idaho
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Vida May Myers, 20 Aug 1951, Price, Carbon, Utah
2 CONT
2 CONT Obituary - Andrew Romero, 88, died 30 Nov 1958 at Soda.  Born 6 June 1870 in Fairview, Utah to John and Cecelia Pehrson Romero. He married Hannah M. Eliasons (sic) 6 June 1888 at Mt. Pleasant, Utah. She died 1937 and he married Je
2 CONC nnie Lau Colburn. They were divorced 1950, and he married Vida Mae Myers Bryson at Price, Utah. She died 1958, February. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors: Seven sons & 4 daughters, James, Victor, A. Lee, Kenneth, Ervin, Golden, Forrest, Mrs. Eugene Jewett, Mrs. Vernal Hopkins, Mrs. O. S. Bybee, Mrs. William Danks, a half brother Ray Romero. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral 3 Dec 1958 at Soda. Burial in Fairview Cemetery in Soda Springs.
2 CONT
