1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Obit in The Albuquerque Journal, March 12, 2002:
2 CONT
2 CONT WARNER -- Mrs. Prejedes "Lele" Warner, 96, went to be with the Lord March 9, 2002. A native New Mexican, she was preceded in death by her son, Desiderio Warner; and brother, Enriquez Gurule. She is survived by her daughter-in-law,
2 CONC  Veronica Warner; five grandchildren, Annette, Raymond, Senaida, Joseph, and Loretta; 15 great-grandchildren; two great-great-grandchildren; several nieces, nephews, other family and friends who loved and will miss her. A Memorial
2 CONC  Rosary will be recited at Sacred Heart Catholic Church, 309 Stover SW., on Tuesday, March 12, 2002 at 7:00 p.m. Burial will be at Mt. Calvary Cemetery on Wednesday, March 13, 2002 at 1:00 p.m. Arrangements by Direct Funeral Servi
2 CONC ces, 2919 4th ST. NW. Albuq. 505-343-8008.
