2 NOTE Thanks for sharing this picture with us. That of course is my father Joe, its a good picture of him. I remember driving up to Woodland every so often on weekends with my brother Matthew and my dad. We would visit with aunt Mary, a
3 CONC unt Sophie, aunt Caroline and grandma Agapita. Uncle Dee would usually meet up with us at one of those places. Uncle Dee would always kid with my brother and me. My father it seemed enjoyed these visits and made the effort to see 
3 CONC them all very often.
