2 FORM jpg
2 TITL July 1979
2 NOTE Oh, and his "famous" cookies.....yummy!!
2 NOTE Great picture. I've never seen it before. Look at that look on my Grandma's face.  Uncle Dee was so funny. Every time he'd come to our house for dinner, we'd have spaghetti. He probably thought that was all we ate. He taught me ho
3 CONC w to eat chile with spaghetti.
