2 CONT Bessie is believed to have been married to a man named Adolph Lovato. Rumor has it, he was an apache indian but havent found anything to back that up. Also, rumor has it, Emilio(2nd spouse)killed Adolph(1st spouse)in the mines. An
2 CONC d that is supposedly the reason they moved to Denver, CO.
