1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  I was born in Cheyenne. My mother Lupe Martinez was born in Chacon New Mexico her father was Sergio Martinez. My ant Hella Duran is her sister wife of David Duran now deceased. She had two brothers and 10 sisters.
2 CONC  Ursula was married to my grandfather Sergio Martinez for only a short time. And I remember that being in the sixties. I remember they would travel in the backseat with my mother and father when I was a child. Randy Murray 3-20-20
2 CONC 17
2 CONT
