1 NOTE {geni:about_me} When Jacob A Vigil was born on October 19, 1924, in Los Angeles, California, his father, Solomon, was 22 and his mother, Josephine, was 21. He served in the military starting on April 5, 1943 and was honorably disc
2 CONC harged on January 29, 1946, after Campaigns in the Asiatic Pacific Theater during World War II.  He married Maria de Assumpcao Cardoso on May 10,1964 in Los Angeles, California.  They had three children with during their marriage.
2 CONC  He died on August 2, 2007, in Coos Bay, Oregon, at the age of 82.
