1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Information below taken from personal journal of Charlotte Gunnell: HARLAND VICTOR ROMERO died 10 Nov 1969 at Soda. Born 27 Aug 1907 at Mt. Pleasan (sic) [Pleasant], Utah to Andrew & Hannah Martensen Romero, 9th of
2 CONC  13 children. He married Vera Gean Borrowman. After their second child was born, they divorced. The youngest, Harold stayed with his father. Funeral 14 Nov in Soda Sp. Burial in Fairview Cemetery in Soda Sp. He is also survived by
2 CONC  a daughter Maria, Mrs. John Kidd, four brothers & one sister, Ervin, Kenneth, Forest & James Romero and Faunda Bybee.
