2 NOTE Great picture of old school Garcia's.
2 NOTE As for T-Boo I don't think anyone knew his real name. I just know Uncle Gilbert liked that kid. He was always at our house. I wonder if we could google him! The date of Renita & Mike's Wedding, we will have to ask her.
2 NOTE I remember that wedding...  that was a classic.  What year was that?  I had to be under 5 or so.  I even rememeber the place where it was near McBryde Ave in Richmond.  MAn, you all look so young, amazing.  This how I remember a l
3 CONC ot of you when I was a child.  The Golden Age od the Garcia's.  Grandma Charlotte and her giant pan of beans living near Easter Hill.  Remember Dolphie?  Neighbors kid was Kenny, then Shirley, how about T-Boo!!  What was that kids
3 CONC  real name?
2 NOTE Check out those hair dos!!  How much hairspray do you think it took to keep those beehives from falling?!  I LOVE IT!!
