2 TITL Family lunch 3/09
2 NOTE My brother really liked our family luncheons.  He would always ask when the next  will be.  The nieces and nephews loved getting together with him. He loved to tease them.  He will always be in my heart.  My brother my friend
2 NOTE Yes, he will be missed, and he will always be in our hearts. And we will continue our lunches in his honor.
2 NOTE What a wonderful luncheon that day....we all had a great time with Uncle Eddie...I will miss him tremendously
2 NOTE Uncle Eddie will be missed and remembered always!
